   "agent_notes": [
    "Radak reads 'he rose in that night' as after a little sleep; I put the crossing near midnight. Rashbam sees a flight by another route. Whether Mahanaim and Penuel (1 km apart in the registry) lie north of the Jabbok, as the narrative implies, is not settled by the coordinates (both ~16 km north of the registry's Jabbok point); no travel time depends on it."
